{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "17375db7-4d41-8498-acd9-aadbb414f9ca",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T13:27:47-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Liam Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. This is Liam Quinn. I'm calling about snow plowing. Sorry, I'm in the middle of my lunch here. Got a turkey sandwich going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, take your time. What's going on with the plowing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:39-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The sidewalk by the school down the road from me was never cleared. That storm Sunday into Monday, the snow that turned to rain. It's Tuesday now. Still not touched."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:23:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And which school are we talking about, do you know the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:04-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the one close to my place. I'm at 355 Ocean Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. The sidewalk runs along the front of the school, a few hundred feet from my house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. 355 Ocean Avenue, sidewalk along the school nearby, not cleared since the storm. Is it the whole stretch or just parts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:37-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The whole stretch. It was heavy, wet snow, then the rain came and it froze up some. Now it's a lumpy mess of ice. The road got plowed. The sidewalk did not."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:24:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that rain on top makes it worse. Are kids walking in the road because of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:05-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some of them are. I've watched them go out into the street, around the lumps. In the morning mostly. It's not a good arrangement."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:19-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it's not. Let me write this down. Sidewalk at the school, ice and packed snow, kids walking in the street. Anything else I should put in the note?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:36-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just that I'd like a plow to come back out. Whoever did the road should come back and do the sidewalk. I called nobody before today, so this is the first report."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:25:54-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll put in a request for a return pass. I can't tell you the exact time, crews are still catching up after that storm, but it'll go to the crew supervisor today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:26:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today. All right. I'd have thought somebody would have been by already, being a school."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:26:22-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I hear you. Sometimes school sidewalks fall on a different list, so I'll flag it so it gets looked at. Is the school open this week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:26:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Open. Buses came this morning. I saw them from the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:26:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good to know, that helps with priority. Can I get a callback number in case the crew has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:26:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0178."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:26:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0178. And that's Liam Quinn, Q-U-I-N-N?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:27:03-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two Ns, yes. That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:27:07-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So, 355 Ocean Avenue, the school sidewalk nearby, request to send a plow back. I'll get it in right after we hang up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:27:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I'll check the sidewalk tomorrow morning. If it's still there, I'll call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:27:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. Just mention today's request when you call and we can pull it up. Enjoy the rest of your sandwich."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:27:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T13:27:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye now."
    }
  ],
